title_i18n":{"cn":"击败冰之恶魔","en":"Defeat Cryonaia","jp":"氷のカタストロフを倒す","kr":"얼음의 악마 처치하기"},"objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"在瓦丽卡的回忆中，那场令她抱憾终生的战斗发生了奇迹般的变化！持有死神之剑的瓦丽卡真正背负了属于“英雄”的命运——直面冰之恶魔，同她战斗！","en":"Valka's memory of the battle that haunted her with regret has miraculously changed! Wielding the Sword of Death, she now steps into her role as a true hero. Confront Cryonaia and defeat her!","jp":"ヴェリカの記憶――彼女にとって一生涯の悔いとなったあの戦いが、奇跡の変化を遂げていたのだ。死神の剣を手にしたヴェリカは真の「英雄」の運命を背負い、氷のカタストロフに立ち向かう。彼女と共に戦おう！","kr":"발리카의 기억 속에서 그녀가 평생 후회했던 전투가 기적적으로 바뀌었다! 죽음의 신의 검을 든 발리카는 진정한 “영웅”의 운명을 짊어지고 얼음의 악마와 맞선다. 그녀와 함께 싸우자!"},"assembly_key":"season_3/season_3/main_story/13010113"}},"timeline/timeline_story_13110950":{"objective:13010113:3:6":{"step":"13010113:3:6","rules":[{"kind":"scripted_encounter_finished","state":"DramaMonster_Finished","object_ids":["507800144"],"operator":">=","count":1}],"objects":[{"id":"507800144","type":"58","client_type":"UnbeatableMonster","battle_group_id":"110947","flow_canvas":"","auto_interact":"false","interaction_candidates":[{"state":"1","condition":"ed.ConditionX.CanBeOverwhelmedInRetro()","options":[{"id":"32","type":"Overwhelm","active_interact":"false"}]},{"state":"2","condition":"ed.ConditionX.CanBeOverwhelmed()","options":[{"id":"32","type":"Overwhelm","active_interact":"false"},{"id":"2","type":"Battle","active_interact":"true"},{"id":"1","type":"Info","active_interact":"false"}]},{"state":"3","condition":"ed.ConditionX.HasState(\"CMark_1\")","options":[{"id":"2","type":"Battle","active_interact":"true"},{"id":"1","type":"Info","active_interact":"false"}]},{"state":"4","condition":"true","options":[{"id":"2","type":"Battle","active_interact":"true"},{"id":"1","type":"Info","active_interact":"false"}]}],"note":"conditional options; no state selection or automatic/manual exclusivity inferred"}],"context_guards":[],"start":"enemy_interaction","retry":false,"predecessors":["5"],"evidence":{"condition":"ed.ConditionX.StateCount(\"DramaMonster_Finished\",5078